[ ] Define the assurance model and evidence taxonomy =assurance-model $Document what coverage, mutation, property, conformance, integration, and end-to-end evidence can establish; define critical seams and dispositions for equivalent, low-value, and deferred findings.$ !1 #019ff964-0343-7d50-a584-0fab09e6d744
[ ] Seal current identity and durable-mutation gaps =critical-contracts $Add compact semantic contracts for reference routing, template targeting, and the highest-risk action, charter, and plan lifecycle paths revealed by coverage and mutation analysis.$ !1 #019ff964-0351-7c21-8224-e74ab64e9090
[ ] Establish trustworthy coverage and mutation reporting =assurance-reporting $Standardize subprocess-aware LLVM coverage and focused cargo-mutants workflows, retain machine-readable artifacts, and report critical unresolved findings without treating aggregate scores as goals.$ !2 #019ff964-035b-7fe2-8db7-4656edd1e902
[ ] Consolidate semantic workspace test builders =workspace-test-builder $Remove repeated temporary workspace and XDG setup within owning repositories; extract across repositories only when a second real consumer justifies a stable dev-only boundary.$ !2 #019ff964-0363-7572-9072-ed651fe5317e
[ ] Create a canonical conformance fixture pattern =conformance-fixtures $Define versioned cases that can carry source, expected diagnostics, normalized meaning, rendering, and wire expectations; prove the pattern across at least two owning layers and detect vendored-fixture drift.$ !2 #019ff964-036d-7320-bd81-6a4f014daa0b
[ ] Introduce property generators for foundational invariants =property-generators $Build generators only for valid domain and workspace states needed to prove semantic round trips, formatter idempotence, mutation locality, stable identity, recurrence-key equivalence, and recoverable atomic writes.$ !2 #019ff964-0377-7ed2-96ac-0faec953f984
[ ] Add one pinned-platform validation entry point =platform-validation $Provide fast, scheduled, and release validation depths that orchestrate each repository's owned checks and verify the exact pinned submodule composition without replacing independent repository CI.$ !3 #019ff964-0381-72b0-ac4b-11968a3afc29
[ ] Document assurance guidance and close the charter =assurance-guidance $Record technique selection, ownership boundaries, artifact interpretation, residual risks, and the evidence expected from future feature charters; review the done gate and close this bounded uplift.$ !3 #019ff964-038a-74c1-9ee2-b3a27c208afd
